# A migration's cutover installs a policy as a transform remediation does.
MODULE: MigrationKeepsPolicyMigrationInstalls
TARGET: MigrationKeepsPolicy
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a migration installs a policy at its cutover
PERTURBS: CutPolicy

--- FIND
    /\ policy' = IF mode = "Transform" THEN "New" ELSE policy
--- REPLACE
    /\ policy' = "New"
--- END
